<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on Nikkei 225 index.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on Nikkei 225 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp, London has issued 1.5 million American-style call and put warrants, in three equal tranches, on the Nikkei 225 index, lead manager Schweizerischer Bankverein (Deutschland) said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 22.JAN.97-18.DEC.97   LISTING   FFURT, DUSS</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    100			 SPOT REF  18109.0 YEN</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	    STRIKE	 ISSUE	 PREMIUM    GEARING</p>
<p> CALL	    18000 YEN    2.26 DEM    8.59 PCT   10.88 X</p>
<p> PUT	     18000 YEN    2.04 DEM    8.90 PCT   12.06 X</p>
<p> PUT	     17000 YEN    1.46 DEM    12.06 PCT  16.85 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
